WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.001
The empirical study uses two kinds of data.

00:00:03.081 --> 00:00:04.362
For generalization,

00:00:04.442 --> 00:00:10.238
the authors run kernel regression with the Tree NTK
on ninety real-world datasets,

00:00:10.318 --> 00:00:16.615
comparing against the kernel of an infinitely wide
multi-layer perceptron and the classic

00:00:16.695 --> 00:00:18.693
radial basis function kernel.

00:00:18.773 --> 00:00:22.061
Tree depth is tuned from one up to twenty-nine,

00:00:22.141 --> 00:00:26.002
and the split-hardness parameter alpha is swept widely.

00:00:26.082 --> 00:00:28.366
For measuring computational cost,

00:00:28.446 --> 00:00:34.170
they use a synthetic dataset of three hundred
samples with ten Gaussian features.
